OL,3,GNEWSAMum calls on police to 'step up'
OL,4,Aover US shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a British woman who was
OL,7,Fshot and killed by her father in Texas
OL,8,Fis calling on her local police force to
OL,9,F"step up" and "engage" with their
OL,10,Fcounterparts in the US.
OL,12,FA UK coroner found Lucy Harrison, 23,
OL,13,Ffrom Warrington, was unlawfully killed
OL,14,Fwhen she was shot in the chest on 10
OL,15,FJanuary 2025 in Prosper, Dallas.
OL,17,FBut no criminal case has been brought
OL,18,Fagainst her father Kris Harrison in the
OL,19,FUS after a grand jury in Collin County
OL,20,Fdeclined to indict him.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
