OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum calls on police to 'step up'
OL,4,Aover US shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy's mother Jane Coates has written
OL,7,Fto Cheshire Police urging them to
OL,8,F"gather evidence" here locally, and
OL,9,Fthen "liaise" with Prosper Police. The
OL,10,Fforce said it was reviewing the letter
OL,11,Fand would "respond in due course".
